        mechanisms: ["Nrf2 activation (upregulates 200+ genes: SOD, GST, NQO1)", "Phase 2 detox & heavy metal excretion", "Anti-inflammatory & HDAC inhibition (epigenetic)", "Gut barrier & microbiome support", "Studied for brain markers & cell-growth pathways in models"],
