        dosage: "Common mistaken: 5–20 mg 'pre-workout' or with caffeine for 'stubborn fat' or ED", synergies: [],
        gorkipedia: "Gorkipedia Entry (WARNING): Yohimbine is a stimulant-like supplement with a poor tolerability record. Case reports include emergency visits for panic and high blood pressure in otherwise healthy adults. Spot-reduction fat-loss claims are weak relative to the cardiovascular and anxiety reports. Extra caution if anxiety or blood pressure is already an issue.",
